      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZAZU'S JOURNEY (8) is a talented type who notched his 6th career success when too good (29.70) at this track last time. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Looks to have an edge on most of these. CASH RIOT (3) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 3.5 lengths at this track in a handy 29.72 beating HARA'S TANK. Won at his only start from this draw. Can measure up again. VICTORY EXAM (1) jumped from the inside and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 1.5 lengths (29.97) behind MONDO CORTEZ at this track. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Hard to beat again. BRAY'S ACE (7) must be included on latest effort.",
